Settings = Settings
NSADDEINVOICING_GENERAL1=Options
NSADDEINVOICING_DROPDOWN_OVERFLOW = Force the dropdown list to overflow the popup
NSADDEINVOICING_DROPDOWN_OVERFLOW_Tooltip = In the "Change reference" window, the product list is displayed above the popup instead of inside it. Enable it if the list is cut off or badly displayed (browsers on macOS in particular).
NSADDEINVOICING_POPUP_HEIGHT = Force the popup height to the height of the standard dropdown list
NSADDEINVOICING_POPUP_HEIGHT_Tooltip = In the "Change reference" window, the popup is extended downwards by the height of the product list (search field and 200 px of results): the list opened below the last line fits inside the popup without being cut off (display on macOS).

